==English==
===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# [[illness]] caused by a previous night of [[heavy drinking]].
#: ''I really enjoyed yesterday's party, but now I have the biggest '''hangover''' &mdash; I'll not be doing that again in a while.''
# an unpleasant [[relic]] left from prior events.

